    "# Main file \n",
    "\n",
    "05.11.2025\n",
    "\n",
    "Written by: Arnav Kumar Upadhyay, Cedric Meyer adapted from MATLAB code of Marc, Jan Spindler DOI-https://doi.org/10.1021/acssynbio.4c00578\n",
    "\n",
    "This script is the main script for the TXTL v2 model in INDEPENDENT GENE SIMULATION mode.\n",
    "\n",
    "The script simulates each gene independently without competition for shared resources.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cfbc25df",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Settings"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "d03ea413",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
